---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/work-checks-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/work-checks-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="What a look at the linked work found"
  caption="The research pile only: 121 looks, four verdicts."
>
  A single bar split four ways, for 121 looks at linked work in the research pile. Strong: 33. OK: 52. Weak: 9. Not checkable: 27.
</Chart>
